461C   F5                     PUSH   AF   ; Save flags to check them later
461D   78                     LD   A,B   
461E   EE AA                  XOR   0xAA   
4620   C2 1F 00               JP   NZ,ERROR   
4623   79                     LD   A,C   
4624   EE AA                  XOR   0xAA   
